  "instructions": [
    "Cut the potatoes into wedges and fry in vegetable oil at 350\u000520F for 5 minutes.",
    "Drain the potatoes on paper towels and sprinkle with salt and pepper.",
    "In a separate pan, fry the buns in vegetable oil at 350\u000520F for 2 minutes on each side.",
    "In a bowl, mix together the German mustard and mayonnaise.",
    "Assemble the burgers by spreading the German mustard mixture on the bottom bun, followed by a slice of cheese, a few pieces of bacon, a lettuce leaf, a tomato slice, and finally the top bun.",
    "Repeat the process for the remaining burgers and serve immediately."
